*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  keyword of 5GC001527 feature in the case of Classical Fullstack
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : Check UE attach status with/without 256QAM configuration
...
